# Used instead of .dockerignore when building Dockerfile.portal (BuildKit).
# The operator's .dockerignore only lets Go files in; the portal also needs web/.
**

# Go source (not tests) and module files
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go
!go.mod
!go.sum

# The web UI sources, but never installed packages or previous builds
!web/
!web/**
**/node_modules
web/dist
